   "paragraphLead": "凤姐儿正自看园中的景致",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C11-041",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "凤姐儿正自看园中的景致，一步步行来赞赏。猛然从假山石后走过一个人来，向前对凤姐儿说道：“请嫂子安。”",
  "title": "假山石后走出人来",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "show",
    "actor": "jia_rui",
    "at": "plum_grove"
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c11-garden",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "会芳园",
  "focus": "plum_grove",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 11,
   "paragraphLead": "凤姐儿正自看园中的景致",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C11-042",
  "speaker": "feng",
  "text": "凤姐儿猛然见了，将身子望后一退，说道：“这是瑞大爷不是？”",
  "title": "猛然一退",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "feng",
    "kind": "anger",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
 {
