  "place": "会芳园",
  "focus": "garden_center",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 11,
   "paragraphLead": "凤姐儿正自看园中的景致",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C11-043",
  "speaker": "jia_rui",
  "text": "贾瑞说道：“嫂子连我也不认得了？不是我是谁！”",
  "title": "嫂子连我也不认得",
  "actions": [
