 {
  "chapter": "c11-winter",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 11,
   "paragraphLead": "且说贾瑞到荣府来了几次",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C11-060",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "此后凤姐儿不时亲自来看秦氏。秦氏也有几日好些，也有几日仍是那样。贾珍、尤氏、贾蓉好不焦心。",
  "title": "不时来看秦氏",
  "actions": []
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c11-winter",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 11,
   "paragraphLead": "且说贾瑞到荣府来了几次",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C11-061",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "且说贾瑞到荣府来了几次，偏都遇见凤姐儿往宁府那边去了。这年正是十一月三十日冬至。",
  "title": "贾瑞来了几次",
  "actions": [],
  "offscreen": true
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c11-winter",
  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
