  "scene": "c5_ningfu",
  "place": "秦氏卧房",
  "focus": "screen_bed",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 11,
   "paragraphLead": "且说贾瑞到荣府来了几次",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C11-063",
  "speaker": "narrator",
  "text": "到了初二日，吃了早饭，凤姐儿来到宁府，看见秦氏的光景，虽未甚添病，但是那脸上身上的肉全瘦干了。",
  "title": "身上的肉全瘦干了",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "show",
    "actor": "qin_ke",
    "at": "screen_bed"
